  "body": "Nestled in a peaceful cul-de-sac and positioned to capture beautiful coastal vistas, this substantial weatherboard residence offers an exceptional blend of space, comfort, and versatility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nDesigned with families in mind, the home enjoys a practical layout with multiple living zones and seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The stylish modern kitchen forms the heart of the home, connecting effortlessly to expansive living and dining areas that open onto sunny decks and landscaped grounds.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is where this home truly shines. The impressive master suite enjoys elevated sea views, creating a peaceful retreat where you can wake up to stunning coastal outlooks each morning. Complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, it offers the perfect sanctuary away from the rest of the home.\r\n\r\nThe spacious upstairs family lounge is another standout feature, boasting panoramic sea views that provide a spectacular backdrop for relaxing, entertaining guests, or enjoying unforgettable sunsets with family and friends. Large windows frame the outlook beautifully, bringing natural light and coastal scenery into everyday living.\r\n\r\nAdding further flexibility is the self-contained granny flat configuration downstairs, featuring a bedroom, living area and bathroom setup, ideal for extended family, teenagers, guests, work-from-home opportunities or supplementary income potential.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n* Panoramic sea views\r\n* Multiple living areas across two levels\r\n* Self-contained granny flat potential\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to decks and entertaining spaces\r\n* Close to Silverdale's schools, shops, transport links and amenities",
